## Major Integrations

Integration Name: Base (Coinbase OP Stack Chain)
Integrated With: Coinbase / Base
Purpose: First major OP Stack chain outside OP Mainnet; shares OP Stack codebase, contributes to Superchain vision, revenue sharing via sequencer fees (HIGH) [Base Blog, https://base.org/building-on-base]
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-013
Sources: https://base.org/building-on-base; https://superchain.optimism.io/

Integration Name: World Chain (Tools for Humanity OP Stack Chain)
Integrated With: Tools for Humanity / World Chain
Purpose: OP Stack chain for Worldcoin/World ID ecosystem; expands Superchain user base (HIGH) [Worldcoin Blog, https://worldcoin.org/blog/engineering/introducing-world-chain]
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-020
Sources: https://worldcoin.org/blog/engineering/introducing-world-chain; https://superchain.optimism.io/

Integration Name: Zora Network (Zora OP Stack Chain)
Integrated With: Zora / Zora Network
Purpose: OP Stack chain for NFT protocol; brings creator economy to Superchain (HIGH) [Zora Blog, https://zora.co/blog/zora-network]
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-015
Sources: https://zora.co/blog/zora-network; https://superchain.optimism.io/

Integration Name: Mode (Mode OP Stack Chain)
Integrated With: Mode
Purpose: OP Stack chain focused on DeFi; expands Superchain DeFi ecosystem (HIGH) [Mode Blog, https://mode.network/blog]
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-016
Sources: https://mode.network/blog; https://superchain.optimism.io/

Integration Name: Fraxtal (Frax Finance OP Stack Chain)
Integrated With: Frax Finance / Fraxtal
Purpose: OP Stack chain for Frax stablecoin and DeFi ecosystem (HIGH) [Frax Blog, https://frax.finance/blog/fraxtal-launch]
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-021
Sources: https://frax.finance/blog/fraxtal-launch; https://superchain.optimism.io/

Integration Name: Lyra (Lyra OP Stack Chain)
Integrated With: Lyra / Lyra Chain
Purpose: OP Stack chain for decentralized options exchange (HIGH) [Lyra Blog, https://lyra.finance/blog/lyra-chain]
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-017
Sources: https://lyra.finance/blog/lyra-chain; https://superchain.optimism.io/

Integration Name: Superchain Registry
Integrated With: All OP Stack Chains (30+)
Purpose: On-chain and off-chain registry tracking all OP Stack chains, configurations, and interop status (HIGH) [GitHub, https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry]
Status: Live
Related Historical Event ID: EV-029
Sources: https://superchain.optimism.io/; https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry

Integration Name: Granite Interop (Planned)
Integrated With: All OP Stack Chains
Purpose: Native cross-chain messaging between OP Stack chains via shared sequencing and interop contracts (HIGH) [Optimism Blog, https://optimism.io/blog/granite]
Status: Planned / Beta (testnet testing)
Related Historical Event ID: EV-028
Sources: https://optimism.io/blog/granite; https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/op-stack/blob/master/specs/interop/interop.md

Integration Name: Optimism Gateway (Official Bridge UI)
Integrated With: Standard Bridge Contracts
Purpose: Official UI for depositing/withdrawing assets between L1 and L2 (HIGH) [Optimism Gateway, https://gateway.optimism.io/]
Status: Live
Sources: https://gateway.optimism.io/; https://docs.optimism.io/chain/bridges

Integration Name: Airdrop #3 (Superchain Ecosystem)
Integrated With: Base, Zora Network, Mode, Lyra, and other OP Stack chains
Purpose: Distributed OP tokens to users across Superchain ecosystem (HIGH) [Gov Optimism, https://gov.optimism.io/t/airdrop-3-results/5678]
Status: Completed
Sources: https://gov.optimism.io/t/airdrop-3-results/5678

Integration Name: Airdrop #4 (Superchain Ecosystem)
Integrated With: Base, Zora Network, Mode, Fraxtal, Lyra, World Chain, and other OP Stack chains
Purpose: Distributed OP tokens to Superchain ecosystem users and builders (HIGH) [Gov Optimism, https://gov.optimism.io/t/airdrop-4-results/7890]
Status: Completed
Sources: https://gov.optimism.io/t/airdrop-4-results/7890

Integration Name: RetroPGF Rounds (Cross-ecosystem Funding)
Integrated With: Public goods projects across Ethereum, OP Mainnet, and OP Stack chains
Purpose: Retroactive funding for public goods benefiting the broader ecosystem (HIGH) [Optimism Blog, https://optimism.io/blog/retropgf-3]
Status: Live (Rounds 1-4 completed, ongoing)
Related Historical Event ID: EV-009, EV-010, EV-024, EV-025
Sources: https://optimism.io/blog/retropgf-1; https://optimism.io/blog/retropgf-2; https://optimism.io/blog/retropgf-3; https://optimism.io/blog/retropgf-4

